# --- 引用の情報（LAYERS.md「派生プロジェクトとの関係」）---

cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "EZR and RStudio runtime environment, standalone edition (R 4.6.1, Japanese edition)"
message: "If you publish results obtained with this environment, please cite it using the information below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Imai"
    given-names: "Kei"
    email: "keiimai1220@gmail.com"
    affiliation: "The University of Tokyo, Japan"
abstract: >-
  The standalone edition of the environment that adds EZR (RcmdrPlugin.EZR) to r_46x, a runtime environment template for reproducible analysis (R 4.6.1, Docker, renv, RStudio Server).
  EZR is opened from the RStudio session; its screen is drawn on a virtual display inside the container and shown in the browser through the RStudio Server proxy.
  Nothing needs to be installed on the computer: the Zip carries Python, QEMU and a small Linux virtual machine that runs Docker Engine (Mac with Apple silicon and Windows).
  This is the Japanese edition: the EZR menus and the instructions for users are in Japanese.
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-21"
keywords:
  - reproducible research
  - R
  - EZR
  - RStudio
